'''Manic Jamiera Cat''' (大狂乱のネコジャラミ ''Dai Kyōran no Neko Jarami'', '''Insane Jarami Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Resident Feline (Deadly)|Titan Maniac]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

